# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows / macOS 检出差异
* text=auto eol=lf

# 显式标注二进制，防止被当作文本处理或做 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.qm binary

# GitHub 语言统计：文档、许可证、预览稿不计入代码行数
*.md linguist-documentation
licenses/** linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
preview/** linguist-documentation
